ones, scales, and gothic ornamentation. Her booted foot rests on a battered metal road case wrapped in heavy chains and covered in stickers and band decals.\n\nIn her right hand she grips a massive medieval war scythe, its long wooden shaft wrapped in leather, the enormous curved blade arcing dramatically over her head. Perched on her left fist, talons gripping her knuckles, is a majestic American bald eagle with pristine white head feathers and a sharp yellow beak, staring off to the side with predatory alertness.\n\nStudio lighting is hard and theatrical, casting crisp shadows. The composition is symmetrical, iconic, and poster-like — punk rock goddess of war meets American mythology. Hyperrealistic, high-fashion photography, 8k, sharp detail, magazine cover quality."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 72, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 321, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 51, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [302, 303], "label": "整数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [-1370.3082275390625, -2354.155517578125], "widgets_values": [4], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 171, "type": "Int", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Int"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "seed", "links": [309, 310], "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "size": [246.48362731933594, 82], "pos": [-1338.6151123046875, -2229.110595703125], "widgets_values": [771003391087506, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "